WEBVTT

00:00:04.230 --> 00:00:10.490
Lately, lots of people have been illegally downloading TV shows over the internet.

00:00:10.490 --> 00:00:19.240
Without the rights owner's permission, distribution via bootlegs is illegal.

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:21.290
Please remember that!

00:00:35.720 --> 00:00:39.180
Don't let that stupid calamari get a hold of you!

00:00:39.180 --> 00:00:43.140
Are you letting the sea, the giver of life,
be covered by that thing's evil sticky fluids?!

00:00:43.140 --> 00:00:46.400
All the fishes are crying, dammit!

00:00:47.770 --> 00:00:48.940
I will...

00:00:48.940 --> 00:00:49.860
...prevail!

00:00:52.780 --> 00:00:54.780
This is it! It's payback time!

00:00:54.780 --> 00:00:57.120
Milly's going to turn the tables and show that seafood!

00:00:57.120 --> 00:01:02.120
I'm so lucky to see Episode 18:
"I've Seen the Coast of Love! The Fish Print of Tears!"

00:01:02.450 --> 00:01:05.080
Here it is! Hot!

00:01:06.540 --> 00:01:09.420
What's with that, Alesta?
It was just getting good!

00:01:09.420 --> 00:01:10.960
What do you mean, "it was just getting good"?

00:01:10.960 --> 00:01:13.300
Honestly, just watching you makes me look bad.

00:01:13.300 --> 00:01:16.890
So what? It's my break, I can do anything I want.

00:01:16.890 --> 00:01:19.300
Why are you even here, Alesta?

00:01:19.300 --> 00:01:20.930
I don't recall inviting you to tag along.

00:01:20.930 --> 00:01:21.930
What am I...

00:01:21.930 --> 00:01:24.560
Well, I can do whatever I want to, right?

00:01:27.520 --> 00:01:30.690
Thanks for lending us the car, Manager.

00:01:30.690 --> 00:01:32.400
No problem, it's all good.

00:01:32.400 --> 00:01:34.990
Yes, very good!

00:01:34.990 --> 00:01:38.740
Completely and utterly... great.

00:01:41.200 --> 00:01:43.450
Marvelous!

00:01:43.450 --> 00:01:45.290
Perfect, Hakone!

00:01:46.870 --> 00:01:48.790
<i>Can I really count on her?</i>

00:01:47.750 --> 00:01:48.790
Fabulous!

00:01:48.790 --> 00:01:50.920
What about this one?

00:01:49.880 --> 00:01:51.840
Immaculate!

00:01:56.550 --> 00:01:58.640
Which will it be?

00:02:07.060 --> 00:02:08.100
Alright.

00:02:10.520 --> 00:02:13.230
<i>What will Senny think once he sees it?</i>

00:02:14.230 --> 00:02:16.070
Iono, look over there!

00:02:18.360 --> 00:02:19.160
See it?

00:02:20.740 --> 00:02:22.370
It's the sea!

00:02:24.490 --> 00:02:28.960
Kiseki wa genjitsu no tonari ni aru

00:02:24.490 --> 00:02:28.960
Miracles are right beside reality

00:02:28.960 --> 00:02:32.040
Kanarazu aru

00:02:28.960 --> 00:02:32.040
They're there for sure

00:02:37.840 --> 00:02:43.430
Chiisana tameiki shinpai dakara

00:02:37.840 --> 00:02:43.430
I heave a tiny sigh because I'm worried

00:02:43.760 --> 00:02:49.310
Ushiro sugata mimamotteirunda yo

00:02:43.760 --> 00:02:49.310
From behind you, I'm watching over you

00:02:49.690 --> 00:02:55.280
Kirai dattara konna koto iwanai yo

00:02:49.690 --> 00:02:55.280
I wouldn't be saying this if I hated you

00:02:55.480 --> 00:03:01.450
Kitto hito wa hitori janai

00:02:55.480 --> 00:03:01.450
I know it must be true that no man is an island

00:02:59.900 --> 00:03:02.870
Hitori janai

00:02:59.900 --> 00:03:02.870
You're not alone

00:03:03.530 --> 00:03:09.120
Tatoeba sotto yubisaki ni fureru omoi

00:03:03.530 --> 00:03:09.120
For example, if you gently brush those hopes with your fingertips

00:03:09.500 --> 00:03:15.040
Tatoeba taisetsu na toki wo wasurenaide

00:03:09.500 --> 00:03:15.040
For example, if you never forget these precious times

00:03:15.420 --> 00:03:21.010
Kakato wo motto sukoshi dake takaku agete

00:03:15.420 --> 00:03:21.010
I'll boost you up, just a little higher

00:03:21.300 --> 00:03:26.970
Mieru yo ano ko no hitomi ni utsuru hikari

00:03:21.300 --> 00:03:26.970
Look and see the light reflecting in her eyes

00:03:27.220 --> 00:03:32.850
ENERGY wa sekai no zenbu ni michiteru

00:03:27.220 --> 00:03:32.850
Filling up the whole world with energy

00:03:33.150 --> 00:03:40.650
Ima dake wa chikara wo kashite ageru yo

00:03:33.150 --> 00:03:40.650
Just for now, I'll lend my strength to you

00:03:53.880 --> 00:03:55.590
This is Oowarai Beach.

00:03:54.000 --> 00:04:04.510
Oowarai

00:03:55.130 --> 00:04:04.510
Beach

00:03:55.590 --> 00:03:59.010
A popular swimming spot situated near the capital.

00:03:59.010 --> 00:04:02.180
It's also famous as the location where Knight of Love, Sweety Milly Episode 18:

00:04:02.180 --> 00:04:07.390
"I've Seen the Coast of Love!
The Fish Print of Tears!" was drawn.

00:04:13.060 --> 00:04:14.600
The rapturous rays of the sun!

00:04:14.600 --> 00:04:15.940
The soothing sound of the waves!

00:04:15.940 --> 00:04:17.980
The sweltering sandy beach!

00:04:17.980 --> 00:04:19.530
Summer is here.

00:04:19.530 --> 00:04:24.740
It is, but you don't have to make
such a big deal out of it.

00:04:25.200 --> 00:04:29.950
Judging by your swimsuit, you don't seem to be practicing what you preach.

00:04:30.370 --> 00:04:33.000
It's not a big deal...

00:04:34.040 --> 00:04:37.380
Hey, why are you two following us?

00:04:37.380 --> 00:04:39.920
Who cares? It's no fun if only you get to go the beach.

00:04:39.920 --> 00:04:42.720
So, what do you think of what Alesta's wearing?

00:04:42.720 --> 00:04:44.430
W-Wait!

00:04:48.760 --> 00:04:49.850
<i>He's looking at me.</i>

00:04:50.930 --> 00:04:56.150
<i>Sentou... is looking at me...</i>

00:04:59.440 --> 00:05:00.780
W-What?

00:05:00.780 --> 00:05:05.740
Nothing... It's just kind of nice to see you off-duty.

00:05:07.370 --> 00:05:08.700
"Kind of nice"?

00:05:13.080 --> 00:05:14.620
No way...

00:05:15.500 --> 00:05:17.250
I got a shot of Alesta in her swimsuit!

00:05:17.250 --> 00:05:18.500
Hey!

00:05:18.500 --> 00:05:20.960
Another one of her rare moments.

00:05:22.170 --> 00:05:23.460
What was that for?!

00:05:23.460 --> 00:05:24.720
Shut up.

00:05:25.090 --> 00:05:26.510
You...!

00:05:28.300 --> 00:05:30.720
Why don't you quit acting like a retard?!

00:05:30.720 --> 00:05:33.810
You can't talk back to me!

00:05:34.560 --> 00:05:35.480
Why, you...!

00:05:36.730 --> 00:05:38.100
You two...

00:05:38.980 --> 00:05:40.940
Enough is enough!

00:05:48.160 --> 00:05:50.450
Where could he be...?

00:05:53.370 --> 00:05:57.580
Where did Sentou run off to?

00:05:57.580 --> 00:05:58.960
It's so hot!

00:06:06.470 --> 00:06:07.470
Senny!

00:06:09.010 --> 00:06:12.890
We clear?! Don't ever get on my nerves!

00:06:14.060 --> 00:06:15.350
Senny...

00:06:14.430 --> 00:06:15.350
Got it?!

00:06:15.350 --> 00:06:17.640
What is my brother doing...?

00:06:17.640 --> 00:06:19.020
Say something, you two!

00:06:19.020 --> 00:06:20.100
Summer, huh?

00:06:23.610 --> 00:06:26.110
Happening!

00:06:24.070 --> 00:06:26.110
Happening!

00:06:29.360 --> 00:06:30.110
Take this!

00:06:30.370 --> 00:06:32.120
Back at ya!

00:06:32.120 --> 00:06:32.990
Iono!

00:06:32.990 --> 00:06:33.830
Okay!

00:06:37.330 --> 00:06:39.330
Alesta!

00:06:41.080 --> 00:06:43.210
Come down here for a sec!

00:06:44.590 --> 00:06:46.840
What is it now?

00:06:46.840 --> 00:06:48.970
There, don't move from that spot.

00:06:50.640 --> 00:06:53.970
Let's see... Raise your right hand...

00:06:53.970 --> 00:06:55.180
Like this?

00:06:56.060 --> 00:06:56.850
Doing good!

00:06:56.850 --> 00:07:00.440
Next, put your left hand on your hip.

00:07:02.730 --> 00:07:06.150
Now, spread your legs apart just a bit.

00:07:06.150 --> 00:07:07.240
Like this?

00:07:07.240 --> 00:07:08.740
Hold that pose!

00:07:08.740 --> 00:07:10.740
Okay, say cheese!

00:07:12.160 --> 00:07:15.450
Alright! Look at this, Alesta!

00:07:16.240 --> 00:07:20.160
It's the same pose used for Milly episode 18 eye catch!

00:07:20.160 --> 00:07:21.460
Is that so...

00:07:23.250 --> 00:07:24.960
Next, hold on to this.

00:07:26.210 --> 00:07:27.300
No freaking way!

00:07:30.720 --> 00:07:32.010
Manager, it's coming at you!

00:07:32.590 --> 00:07:35.640
So wonderful... I can't stand it...

00:07:38.850 --> 00:07:39.770
Manager?

00:07:45.650 --> 00:07:48.150
To the right, Senny! It's on the right!

00:07:48.150 --> 00:07:49.690
Then go straight!

00:07:50.610 --> 00:07:51.240
Yeah, that's right!

00:07:51.240 --> 00:07:53.820
A little further, just a little further!

00:07:53.820 --> 00:07:55.740
Sorry, I lied. Head a little left!

00:07:55.740 --> 00:07:59.040
Hey, what do you think the parallel world's watermelons taste like?

00:07:59.040 --> 00:08:00.080
Don't ask me.

00:08:01.160 --> 00:08:02.120
He did it!

00:08:03.960 --> 00:08:05.130
Yes!

00:08:08.760 --> 00:08:10.550
Who wants a piece?

00:08:11.800 --> 00:08:13.010
What's wrong?

00:08:18.140 --> 00:08:18.930
You...

00:08:19.350 --> 00:08:22.140
The parallel world's watermelons are so sweet!

00:08:22.140 --> 00:08:23.190
Scrumptious!

00:08:30.360 --> 00:08:32.150
Home run!

00:08:31.110 --> 00:08:32.150
Here you go.

00:08:32.150 --> 00:08:33.320
Thanks.

00:08:38.740 --> 00:08:39.790
Senny?

00:08:44.250 --> 00:08:46.670
What the heck were you thinking?

00:08:46.670 --> 00:08:49.210
But it looked so delicious!

00:08:57.760 --> 00:08:59.390
That girl.

00:09:01.640 --> 00:09:04.060
<i>I've charged her before...</i>

00:09:04.060 --> 00:09:06.730
<i>Depression level is E, huh?</i>

00:09:07.150 --> 00:09:10.440
<i>But what's with this weird feeling?</i>

00:09:10.440 --> 00:09:13.440
What are you doing with that life checker?

00:09:14.780 --> 00:09:17.870
Hey, Alesta, do you sense anything weird about that girl?

00:09:17.870 --> 00:09:19.830
Aren't we on vacation?

00:09:20.620 --> 00:09:22.700
But it's bugging me...

00:09:22.700 --> 00:09:26.210
Besides, this area isn't under our jurisdiction.

00:09:26.210 --> 00:09:28.380
Emergencies are an exception...

00:09:28.380 --> 00:09:31.380
...but otherwise, we can't interfere.

00:09:31.380 --> 00:09:33.670
What would we do if something bad happened?

00:09:33.670 --> 00:09:35.510
Can you take the blame?

00:09:35.510 --> 00:09:37.180
But...

00:09:37.430 --> 00:09:41.140
Listen. If you do anything rash again, I will report it to the Captain.

00:09:42.350 --> 00:09:45.100
Uh huh... You sure?

00:09:45.100 --> 00:09:46.520
What's that?

00:09:49.900 --> 00:09:54.740
Time for a little quiz. What happens if this video goes online?

00:09:54.740 --> 00:09:55.820
Plug...!

00:09:55.820 --> 00:09:58.660
Hey, want me to delete it? Do ya?

00:09:58.660 --> 00:10:00.780
W-Whatever.

00:10:00.780 --> 00:10:04.080
I'll just upload it to the Corporation's server number two, then...

00:10:04.080 --> 00:10:06.660
Alright! You win, I get it!

00:10:07.710 --> 00:10:12.000
I saw nothing. That's how you want it, right?

00:10:12.250 --> 00:10:14.880
Yep! Thanks a bunch!

00:10:14.880 --> 00:10:15.970
Now then...

00:10:30.770 --> 00:10:32.020
Just a little further!

00:10:32.020 --> 00:10:33.530
Come back here!

00:10:33.530 --> 00:10:34.530
Gotcha!

00:10:36.190 --> 00:10:37.570
Take this!

00:10:38.570 --> 00:10:41.160
Not bad!

00:10:42.370 --> 00:10:43.870
Now you've done it!

00:10:43.870 --> 00:10:45.370
Heavenly...

00:10:45.370 --> 00:10:47.290
What are those two doing?

00:10:47.870 --> 00:10:49.460
Did you say something?

00:10:49.460 --> 00:10:51.170
It's nothing.

00:10:51.170 --> 00:10:53.460
I'll go buy some drinks.

00:10:53.460 --> 00:10:56.510
In that case, I'll have a cold beer!

00:10:56.510 --> 00:10:57.720
Got it.

00:10:58.550 --> 00:11:01.550
This girl... I wonder what's wrong with her?

00:11:05.560 --> 00:11:07.060
Hello?

00:11:10.020 --> 00:11:12.480
That again? Stop it.

00:11:12.480 --> 00:11:16.280
I'm not going back to the countryside and I'm not getting married.

00:11:16.280 --> 00:11:18.440
How many times do I have to tell you that, Mom?

00:11:19.530 --> 00:11:21.410
That doesn't sound good...

00:11:21.410 --> 00:11:25.910
A slump? This kind of thing happens all the time!

00:11:25.580 --> 00:11:26.870
A slump...?

00:11:25.910 --> 00:11:29.290
How can I call myself a writer if I'm always like this?

00:11:29.290 --> 00:11:31.120
A writer?

00:11:31.120 --> 00:11:32.880
I see, she has writer's block right now.

00:11:32.880 --> 00:11:43.140
Face: Editor

00:11:34.130 --> 00:11:37.460
I'm begging you, please give me a little more time!

00:11:37.460 --> 00:11:40.340
My mother, who lives in the countryside, has fallen ill.

00:11:40.340 --> 00:11:43.140
Just give me a little more time and I promise I'll get it done!

00:11:43.140 --> 00:11:46.600
Please! I'm willing to do anything!

00:11:51.020 --> 00:11:56.020
No! You promised you'd wait for my manuscript! Liar!

00:11:56.980 --> 00:11:59.610
What if that's what's happening?!

00:12:00.200 --> 00:12:02.240
I will definitely save you!

00:12:05.530 --> 00:12:08.200
Man, it's really hot.

00:12:09.330 --> 00:12:10.620
Sentou.

00:12:10.620 --> 00:12:12.170
Alesta.

00:12:13.580 --> 00:12:15.170
Plug's not with you?

00:12:16.500 --> 00:12:20.130
It's not like I'm her guardian, you know.

00:12:22.090 --> 00:12:23.840
I-Is that so?

00:12:24.680 --> 00:12:27.850
Mom... Like I said, that's not how it is.

00:12:27.850 --> 00:12:32.060
It's just a little writer's block.

00:12:33.690 --> 00:12:35.900
I told you, it's not like that!

00:12:37.520 --> 00:12:38.780
I'm sick of this!

00:12:47.530 --> 00:12:51.540
No way! How'd she suddenly jump from an E to a C?

00:13:04.630 --> 00:13:07.510
<i>This isn't good, my heart's starting to race...</i>

00:13:08.260 --> 00:13:11.220
<i>When I stand next to Sentou like this...</i>

00:13:11.220 --> 00:13:13.690
<i>It feels as though we're on a date...</i>

00:13:13.690 --> 00:13:15.480
<i>We'd eat shaved ice together...</i>

00:13:17.610 --> 00:13:19.570
Sennykins!

00:13:19.570 --> 00:13:22.440
Alesta!

00:13:25.610 --> 00:13:26.990
Alesta.

00:13:37.960 --> 00:13:39.540
Here I go!

00:13:54.730 --> 00:13:57.150
What's up? You're all red.

00:13:58.400 --> 00:14:00.690
It's nothing! Nothing at all!

00:14:01.320 --> 00:14:04.400
Where'd Plug run off to, anyway?

00:14:04.400 --> 00:14:07.360
Yeah, I'm not sure what she's doing now.

00:14:08.030 --> 00:14:11.910
Could you go find her?

00:14:13.200 --> 00:14:15.750
It's fine if it's too much trouble...

00:14:15.750 --> 00:14:20.750
But if we leave that idiot alone,
she'll probably end up doing something stupid.

00:14:20.750 --> 00:14:22.050
Why?

00:14:22.050 --> 00:14:24.420
What do you mean, "why"?

00:14:24.420 --> 00:14:27.220
Why are you so concerned about Plug...

00:14:27.220 --> 00:14:29.890
No, why are you so concerned about both of us?

00:14:31.850 --> 00:14:35.230
Normally, inhabitants of our world and the parallel world...

00:14:35.230 --> 00:14:37.850
...only interact by charging and being charged.

00:14:39.190 --> 00:14:41.310
You're here on vacation today.

00:14:41.310 --> 00:14:44.190
It should annoy you that we came along.

00:14:45.650 --> 00:14:48.320
And despite that, you still worry about Plug.

00:14:48.700 --> 00:14:50.030
Why?

00:14:54.040 --> 00:14:55.500
That was terrible.

00:14:55.500 --> 00:14:58.080
I argued with Mom for no reason.

00:14:58.080 --> 00:15:02.040
A writer with nothing left to write...
I guess it's the end for me, huh?

00:15:04.210 --> 00:15:08.050
Miss Writer, when do I charge you to get back your confidence?

00:15:10.390 --> 00:15:11.720
I'm a failure.

00:15:22.690 --> 00:15:25.530
I'm really... a failure.

00:15:28.950 --> 00:15:31.200
Her depression level went to B!

00:15:31.820 --> 00:15:34.620
I've got to get ready to charge, just in case!

00:15:34.620 --> 00:15:36.950
No... a power source.

00:15:36.950 --> 00:15:42.670
There aren't any power sources in the middle of the ocean!

00:15:43.590 --> 00:15:45.300
Why do you ask?

00:15:45.590 --> 00:15:48.630
W-Well...

00:15:48.630 --> 00:15:49.800
I'm just curious.

00:15:50.510 --> 00:15:51.760
Well...

00:15:51.760 --> 00:15:54.180
I'm able to see you normally...

00:15:54.180 --> 00:15:55.510
...and talk to you normally.

00:15:55.510 --> 00:15:59.480
I can touch you normally, too.

00:15:59.480 --> 00:16:02.940
I'm already involved, so I might as well stay that way.

00:16:02.940 --> 00:16:06.230
So... you're saying this is just the luck of the draw, right?

00:16:06.230 --> 00:16:08.740
No, that's not exactly it.

00:16:10.200 --> 00:16:11.450
Plug, what is it?!

00:16:11.450 --> 00:16:14.740
The girl I was following dropped to depression level B!

00:16:14.740 --> 00:16:16.910
She needs to be charged!

00:16:17.740 --> 00:16:20.540
But there aren't any power sources in the middle of the ocean!

00:16:20.540 --> 00:16:21.870
What did you expect?!

00:16:23.170 --> 00:16:24.580
What should I do?

00:16:24.580 --> 00:16:26.840
I can't charge her like this!

00:16:26.840 --> 00:16:28.880
Okay, you need to report the situation first.

00:16:28.880 --> 00:16:31.420
Have you contacted the district manager and the Company HQ?

00:16:31.420 --> 00:16:32.380
I did that...

00:16:32.380 --> 00:16:33.970
But they were both too busy!

00:16:33.970 --> 00:16:36.260
I'm not sure if they can make it in time!

00:16:37.760 --> 00:16:38.680
What's wrong?

00:16:38.680 --> 00:16:40.480
Did something happen?

00:16:40.480 --> 00:16:42.140
Sentou...

00:16:42.850 --> 00:16:43.810
Something happened, right?!

00:16:44.940 --> 00:16:45.770
Yes.

00:16:45.770 --> 00:16:47.730
Tell me!

00:16:50.610 --> 00:16:52.200
You sure plug went this way?

00:16:52.200 --> 00:16:53.200
Yes.

00:16:53.200 --> 00:16:55.620
But what do you plan to do, Sentou?

00:16:55.620 --> 00:16:57.660
She just needs a power supply, right?

00:16:57.660 --> 00:16:59.080
Yes, but...

00:16:59.080 --> 00:17:01.790
Don't tell me you plan to use this?

00:17:01.790 --> 00:17:03.790
You got it.

00:17:03.790 --> 00:17:07.130
Will it reach from this turn?

00:17:07.130 --> 00:17:09.630
No, it's not long enough.

00:17:09.630 --> 00:17:11.550
I'll have to jump off then.

00:17:11.550 --> 00:17:13.720
Don't be ridiculous! It's too dangerous!

00:17:13.720 --> 00:17:17.300
I have no choice. It's a life or death situation.

00:17:17.300 --> 00:17:18.810
That's not it!

00:17:18.810 --> 00:17:22.390
Sentou... this is our problem!

00:17:22.390 --> 00:17:25.020
It has nothing to do with you!

00:17:25.020 --> 00:17:27.060
You don't need to do all of this.

00:17:28.020 --> 00:17:31.030
Actually, it does have to do with me.

00:17:31.990 --> 00:17:36.610
They reason they're as happy as they are now is because of you charging ladies.

00:17:38.240 --> 00:17:38.950
Divine!

00:17:38.950 --> 00:17:43.040
I don't like being helped without doing anything in return...

00:17:43.040 --> 00:17:45.040
That's why it has something to do with me.

00:17:45.040 --> 00:17:46.170
Sentou...

00:17:47.380 --> 00:17:50.040
Man, I should stop trying to be cool.

00:17:51.750 --> 00:17:53.050
I understand.

00:17:53.050 --> 00:17:55.340
We'll do it according to your plan.

00:17:55.340 --> 00:17:59.600
But I'll make sure you're safe. I must.

00:17:59.600 --> 00:18:01.560
Thanks. I'm counting on you!

00:18:06.640 --> 00:18:09.440
Depression level has hit A!

00:18:10.820 --> 00:18:12.360
What do I do...?

00:18:14.110 --> 00:18:15.360
Alesta!

00:18:15.360 --> 00:18:18.360
Plug! Sentou got a power supply for you.

00:18:18.360 --> 00:18:19.700
Come and meet us here.

00:18:19.700 --> 00:18:21.030
Power supply?

00:18:23.580 --> 00:18:25.830
Way to go, Sentou!

00:18:33.840 --> 00:18:36.380
What's that?

00:18:39.340 --> 00:18:40.680
A ghost?

00:18:42.760 --> 00:18:44.140
What are you doing?!

00:18:44.140 --> 00:18:45.930
Your stealth's about to wear off!

00:18:45.930 --> 00:18:48.440
My suit got wet and it's going crazy!

00:18:48.440 --> 00:18:49.900
Didn't you make it waterproof?

00:18:49.900 --> 00:18:51.020
I forgot!

00:18:51.020 --> 00:18:53.190
You idiot!

00:18:56.650 --> 00:18:58.660
Hey, what just happened?

00:18:58.660 --> 00:19:01.200
Don't worry. It's nothing I can't handle.

00:19:03.120 --> 00:19:05.620
Plug, I'm coming to help.

00:19:05.620 --> 00:19:07.750
We're going to pull this off!

00:19:08.290 --> 00:19:10.170
Okay, looks like now's my chance.

00:19:10.920 --> 00:19:15.050
You can only use the refresher when the car is in the air, got it?

00:19:15.050 --> 00:19:16.050
Yeah!

00:19:16.840 --> 00:19:18.630
Fly!

00:19:24.220 --> 00:19:26.680
Sentou, preparations complete!

00:19:26.680 --> 00:19:28.690
Here we go!

00:19:33.860 --> 00:19:36.570
Plug, don't screw this up!

00:19:39.240 --> 00:19:41.450
Reach me!

00:19:43.620 --> 00:19:45.910
Thanks, Sentou! Alesta!

00:19:47.040 --> 00:19:48.040
Sentou!

00:19:49.870 --> 00:19:52.040
Thanks, Alesta!

00:19:52.040 --> 00:19:53.250
How's Plug?

00:19:54.290 --> 00:20:00.550
Fight! In one strike! Charge!

00:20:05.010 --> 00:20:06.640
I did it!

00:20:09.640 --> 00:20:11.350
Charging complete!

00:20:11.640 --> 00:20:13.860
That's right, a ghost, it was a ghost!

00:20:13.860 --> 00:20:15.690
The heroine is a ghost!

00:20:15.690 --> 00:20:17.650
This will definitely work!

00:20:17.650 --> 00:20:22.360
The supernatural mystery novel she began writing with the heroine being a ghost...

00:20:22.360 --> 00:20:25.910
...turned out to be a hit that opened new doors for her career.

00:20:25.910 --> 00:20:28.370
But that's another story altogether.

00:20:30.250 --> 00:20:32.250
T-The car...

00:20:32.250 --> 00:20:33.790
Why did this happen?

00:20:39.260 --> 00:20:42.090
So sorry, Manager.

00:20:42.090 --> 00:20:43.720
I'll pay for it.

00:20:44.090 --> 00:20:46.180
I'm really sorry!

00:20:46.180 --> 00:20:47.260
Charge.

00:20:48.680 --> 00:20:52.020
Oh, well! It was a second-hand clunker anyway.

00:20:52.020 --> 00:20:55.650
I think I'll just get a new one.

00:20:57.320 --> 00:20:59.110
Is this really okay?

00:21:02.360 --> 00:21:03.070
<i>This can't be...</i>

00:21:04.240 --> 00:21:07.080
<i>While the number of cases she resolved is extremely low,</i>

00:21:07.080 --> 00:21:10.450
<i>there are no repeaters among the people she's charged.</i>

00:21:10.450 --> 00:21:12.040
<i>Except for that lady.</i>

00:21:12.040 --> 00:21:13.750
<i>That's impossible.</i>

00:21:13.750 --> 00:21:16.080
<i>I've never seen this sort of data before.</i>

00:21:16.080 --> 00:21:16.750
<i>But...</i>

00:21:16.960 --> 00:21:20.260
Plug has something you don't.

00:21:21.340 --> 00:21:24.880
<i>Is this what the Captain meant?</i>

00:21:24.880 --> 00:21:26.470
<i>Could Plug be...</i>

00:21:26.470 --> 00:21:27.510
What are you looking at?

00:21:29.010 --> 00:21:30.060
Plug?

00:21:30.060 --> 00:21:32.890
What are you looking at, Alesta?

00:21:32.890 --> 00:21:34.190
Nothing at all!

00:21:34.190 --> 00:21:37.060
That makes me even more curious.

00:21:37.060 --> 00:21:40.440
Show it to me, please?

00:21:39.230 --> 00:21:39.900
Hey, stupid!

00:21:39.900 --> 00:21:41.530
Where are you touching me?!

00:21:41.530 --> 00:21:44.990
How about here... feels good, doesn't it?

00:21:46.450 --> 00:21:47.820
Why, you...

00:21:49.990 --> 00:21:50.950
You idiot!

00:21:50.950 --> 00:21:52.290
It can't be you!

00:21:52.290 --> 00:21:53.750
Definitely not!

00:21:53.750 --> 00:21:59.500
I was going to thank you for helping me earlier, but... forget it!

00:22:02.960 --> 00:22:04.260
Hey, you two.

00:22:04.260 --> 00:22:06.470
What's going on...

00:22:08.050 --> 00:22:09.720
Hey, stop it.

00:22:12.890 --> 00:22:14.480
You know...

00:22:17.310 --> 00:22:20.400
A solid hit!

00:22:20.400 --> 00:22:21.940
It's going deep right field...

00:22:21.940 --> 00:22:25.610
He did it! A come-from-behind, walk-off grand slam!

00:22:35.660 --> 00:22:39.170
Honto wa totemo TOUGH nan da yo

00:22:35.660 --> 00:22:39.170
Really, I'm quite tough, you know

00:22:39.170 --> 00:22:41.960
Hitori demo heiki de

00:22:39.170 --> 00:22:41.960
I'm fine even all by myself

00:22:41.960 --> 00:22:44.710
Doko ni demo ikeru no

00:22:41.960 --> 00:22:44.710
I can go anywhere at all

00:22:44.710 --> 00:22:47.510
Koibito nante iranai

00:22:44.710 --> 00:22:47.510
I don't need a boyfriend or anything

00:22:47.510 --> 00:22:52.970
Takumashiku ikiteikunda to kimetetanda

00:22:47.510 --> 00:22:52.970
I decided that I would live strong

00:22:52.970 --> 00:22:54.770
Kimi to deau made wa

00:22:52.970 --> 00:22:54.770
Until the day I could meet you

00:22:59.980 --> 00:23:02.770
Sore wa arigachi na

00:22:59.980 --> 00:23:02.770
"That really is

00:23:02.770 --> 00:23:05.570
Warui kuse da yo

00:23:02.770 --> 00:23:05.570
It's a bad habit

00:23:05.570 --> 00:23:08.320
Hanashi janai ka? nante

00:23:05.570 --> 00:23:08.320
such an often-heard saying, right?"

00:23:08.320 --> 00:23:11.120
Toshiue buranaide ne

00:23:08.320 --> 00:23:11.120
Don't pretend to be older than you are

00:23:11.120 --> 00:23:16.290
Datte ne watashi wa itsumo tokubetsu

00:23:11.120 --> 00:23:16.290
But you know, I'm always an exceptional case

00:23:16.660 --> 00:23:19.420
Kimi ni mo kitto SPECIAL deshou

00:23:16.660 --> 00:23:19.420
I'm sure I'm special to you, too

00:23:19.420 --> 00:23:21.130
Sore de nakya iya

00:23:19.420 --> 00:23:21.130
I couldn't stand it any other way

00:23:21.500 --> 00:23:24.960
Zettai watashi soba ni iru yo

00:23:21.500 --> 00:23:24.960
I'll definitely always be beside you

00:23:24.960 --> 00:23:33.010
Kimi ga ochikondara namida fusegu kasa ni naritainda yo

00:23:24.960 --> 00:23:29.090
I want to become the umbrella

00:23:29.090 --> 00:23:33.010
that shields you from tears when you're feeling down

00:23:33.300 --> 00:23:38.560
Keredo mamoreteru no wa naze ka watashi bakari

00:23:33.300 --> 00:23:35.930
But why is it that I'm the one

00:23:35.930 --> 00:23:38.560
who always ends up being protected?

00:23:38.890 --> 00:23:44.860
Kimochi no naka no koishi ne tsumazuite korobisou na toki

00:23:38.890 --> 00:23:44.860
At the times when, in my heart, I stumble and seem about to fall

00:23:45.070 --> 00:23:49.570
Itsumo sotto sasaete kureru

00:23:45.070 --> 00:23:49.570
Keep supporting me just a little, always

00:23:49.950 --> 00:23:54.080
Futoshita kizuna itoshii yo

00:23:49.950 --> 00:23:54.080
I'll treasure this unexpected bond

00:23:54.080 --> 00:23:55.450
Itsumademo

00:23:54.080 --> 00:23:55.450
Now and forever

00:23:55.830 --> 00:23:59.660
Eien Sweetheart

00:23:55.830 --> 00:23:59.660
Eternally, Sweetheart

00:24:03.460 --> 00:24:05.710
Summer is so great!

00:24:05.710 --> 00:24:08.840
We got to play around, and charge someone who needed charging!

00:24:08.840 --> 00:24:11.090
That was a very fulfilling day. Period.

00:24:11.090 --> 00:24:13.600
You don't think the captain's going to yell at you again?

00:24:13.600 --> 00:24:15.140
Charging somebody outside the area of your jurisdiction.

00:24:15.140 --> 00:24:17.140
Damage to equipment. Damage to parallel-world property.

00:24:17.140 --> 00:24:19.980
As well as other clumsy, destructive actions.

00:24:19.980 --> 00:24:20.440
Then there's...

00:24:20.440 --> 00:24:22.520
It was a very fulfilling day! Period!

00:24:22.520 --> 00:24:24.230
She ignored it.

00:24:24.440 --> 00:24:26.940
On the next episode of
Fight In one Strike! Charging Ladies!!:

00:24:26.360 --> 00:24:33.030
Backfeed

00:24:26.940 --> 00:24:28.110
Backfeed!

00:24:28.110 --> 00:24:33.030
It's the beginning of the first major plot development in Charging Ladies!
